  "visual_comparison": [
    "All nine states show the locked strings, controls and wallet and trust values. Captures use days 8 and 11 with the master's Thursday and Sunday times.",
    "o01 and o07 use the existing Godot map grid, roads, text outlines, scale, gate icon and distinct player and place markers. The Godot HUD has slightly different type, offsets, trust fill and borders. The square has an opaque bar which covers the canal caption, and Make up Dhuhr is present above it. Actions have different widths and gaps. Salma remains in the second row.",
    "o02–o06 and o08–o09 use the existing greybox lane camera, with block walls, flat ground, blue sky and different lighting and framing. The master depicts storefronts, awnings, lanterns, paving and an arch. The live panels use shared fonts, corner radii, opacity, text wrapping, padding and button widths. In o04 the low-funds label is vertically centered with Not now. In o06 and o09 the shared reputation footer and headings have tighter letter spacing, and in o06 the quote, source, divider and good tag use the shared row spacing."
  ],
